{"find": "and this was, I think, the only thing of the kind we saw in Luristan.\n\n[[image: pen drawing of a pointed-arch bridge spanning a deep, narrow rocky gorge, with a small figure standing on a ledge below]]\n[[caption]] The Pul i Tang.", "replace": "and this\n\n[[image: pen drawing of a pointed-arch bridge spanning a deep, narrow rocky gorge, with a small figure standing on a ledge below]]\n[[caption]] The Pul i Tang.\n\n[[cont]]was, I think, the only thing of the kind we saw in Luristan."}